WEBVTT

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:22.240
Pocket Monsters, also known as Pokemon.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.510
Dazzling and awe-inspiring.

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:28.260
The amazing creatures
that thrive on this planet.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:36.580
In number virtually too massive
to even begin to count,

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.290
hundreds, thousands
is a more likely total,

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:42.140
but numerous and varied to be sure.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:14.220
People and Pokemon, competing together
against others in a Pokemon Battle

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:17.940
and hoping to one day
become champions.

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:35.360
Living together,
and reaching out to each other,

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:37.740
as friends and comrades.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:44.860
Which brings us to Ash Ketchum,
from Pallet Town, working with Pikachu,

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:48.360
to catch other Pokemon
and perfect the art of the battle.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.100
Traveling far and wide
with good friends

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.250
while honing his
many battling skills.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:01.590
And with every new Pokemon
our heroes meet along their exciting journey

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:04.370
a new adventure awaits them.

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:09.910
But now ...

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:25.400
Amidst the fearsome distortions
of time and space

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:29.520
one unfortunate encounter
has plunged the planet into crisis.

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:32.920
and given birth to a new hatred.

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:42.990
In the unmoving intertwined
strings of fate

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:47.950
tangled and inexplicable
and seeking an answer beyond time and space

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:52.560
even now there are those
who seek to find an answer.

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:16.480
<i>It is time to return the Jewel of Life.</i>

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:19.400
<i>Well, take it.</i>

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:29.760
<i>What are you doing?
-I can not give you the Jewel of Life.</i>

00:03:30.530 --> 00:03:35.350
<i>You have betrayed me
and are trying to destroy me!</i>

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:47.940
The time has come!

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:55.670
Human beings must be brought
to justice!

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:51.490
ARCEUS
AND THE JEWEL OF LIFE

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:38.520
Ashes journey to become
a Pokemon Master continues.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:41.780
As along Pikachu and his friends,
Dawn and Brock,

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:44.060
he happily arrives in Michina Town.

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:47.090
A beautiful place
surrounded by nature.

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:54.100
All right, everyone!
Come on out!

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:05.430
You guys too!
-All right, and you!

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.400
You think you're funny.

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:08.670
Watermelons.
-They sure are.

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:12.550
Wow! This is our lucky day.
-Hold on!

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.840
See, those watermelons are ours!

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:18.520
They were cooling down by the stream.

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:27.400
What a shame.
-Tough brake.

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:30.790
OK, then you can have
'em on one condition.

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:32.570
Beat us in a battle.

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:35.340
Yeah, well settle this
with a tag battle.

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:42.600
OK, I guess that's only fair.
-Fair and square.

00:10:29.180 --> 00:10:32.590
You really can't come to this town,
without seeing the ruins.

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:36.110
Ruins?
-Yeah, of a temple from thousands of years ago.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:38.330
Hey, the guidebook talks
about them as well.

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:39.630
I wanna see 'em.

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.630
You are gonna love 'em.
There the best!

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:44.630
So, what do you say
we check the ruins out?

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:05.380
The ruins are way up there.

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:10.300
I can feel positive energy
flowing through this place.

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:13.150
Me too.
-It feels so great.

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:37.630
What's that?
-Quick, Pikachu, use Thunder Bolt!

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:46.290
A thunder creature
and creature master, let's hurry!

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:57.640
The Pokemon are running away.
-Something's happening.

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:10.300
Let's move!

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:17.380
Oh, no, Pikachu!
-Piplup!

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:28.500
Now Dialga, come forth!

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:31.260
Dialga, please,
save these Pokemon for me!

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:53.660
The legendary Pokemon that rules time.
-Dialga.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.850
But how?
-And how did she talk to it?

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.440
Hey, Dialga ...

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:55.800
It's Giratina!

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:08.110
It's too dangerous!
Get away, quick!

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:09.890
Right!

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:21.600
Giratina is after Dialga still.
-Please, stop it, Giratina!

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:26.140
Yeah, come on,
Dialga saved Piplup and Pikachu for us!

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:30.650
Giratina.

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:43.260
Now, transcend the confines
of time and space.

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:52.450
Giratina.

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:02.600
Sheena!
-Giratina's rage.

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:04.730
It's just too strong.

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:09.080
Giratina!
Can't you feel I'm right here with you?

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:17.230
Giratina!

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:52.440
So you remembered us.
Wow!

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:59.590
Giratina's rage, it's gone.
Now's the time.

00:15:59.590 --> 00:16:03.400
Transcend the confines
of time and space.

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:08.820
<i>You have misunderstood Dialga.</i>

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:12.480
<i>Please, don't battle.</i>

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:35.860
It looks like Giratina
gets it now.

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:40.120
That's nice if it's true.
But, I should have seen it in its heart.

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:42.210
Should have seen in its heart?

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:45.010
You see, I have the power
to connect my heart

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:46.600
with the hearts of Pokemon.

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:49.610
With Pokemon?
-Then you can connect with Dialga?

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:52.940
Yes, and it surely lend me
some of its strength.

00:16:53.430 --> 00:16:54.980
Dialga has?

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:59.910
Hi, my name is Sheena.
And I'm a guardian of these ruins.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.990
Same here, too.
My name's Kevin.

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:06.050
So were any of you injured?
-No, we're fine.

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:11.590
My name is Dawn.
-My name's Ash and this is my partner Pikachu.

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:13.520
Thanks for saving my buddy.

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:26.520
Long ago, there was a
thunder creature and its master

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:28.850
and they changed the fate of this town.

00:17:30.180 --> 00:17:32.700
Yes, you see, it's part
of the legend of this town.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:35.580
Wait a minute.
A thunder creature and its master?

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:38.220
You mean me and Pikachu.

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:42.280
I have a feeling our meeting
may have been fated.

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:46.190
So would you mind coming with us?
-I'll do whatever you want.

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:48.750
I mean, after all,
you saved Pikachu's life.

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:54.320
Sheena, I'm Brock.
Another fated person.

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:57.890
Why just a short moment ago
I took a fated tumble and

00:17:57.890 --> 00:18:00.460
scraped my elbow.
Which then lead to the fated fact,

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:02.650
that you would kiss it
and make it better.

00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:06.260
And also fate would have you
stroke me with that beautiful hand of yours.

00:18:06.260 --> 00:18:09.700
Which is a miracle
that took away all of my pain.

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:12.720
All because of the fickle finger of fate

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:14.880
and now we get to know each other

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:18.600
and build our feeling on the fated love
that I know is there inside.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:21.210
Such a lovely silken hand ...

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:34.460
Wrong hand.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:57.060
Dialga!

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:00.610
Look out!

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:08.610
Sheena, we got to go,
or we'll get caught in the water spout!

00:19:08.610 --> 00:19:09.670
But, wait ...

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:18.670
It's Palkia!

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:22.240
The legendary Pokemon
that rules space.

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:48.580
Hey, look at that!
-Palkia saved Dialga! Cool.

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:57.860
transcend the confines
of time and space.

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:05.400
Hold on, ...
transcend?

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:07.960
It means rise above
or go over.

00:20:08.610 --> 00:20:10.840
You see, right now Sheena's connected

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:12.750
to the hearts of both of those Pokemon.

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:14.560
She's syncing with them.

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:30.510
<i>Thank you, Palkia, Dialga.</i>

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:45.560
There gone.
-They've returned to their own dimensions.

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:51.090
See that?
I don't believe it.

00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:54.100
I don't get it.
-I don't know what to get.

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:57.020
We saw the time, space Pokemon.

00:20:57.170 --> 00:20:59.720
And a woman who can
control them, as well.

00:20:59.720 --> 00:21:01.660
Tapping into the heart
of Pokemon rocks,

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:04.140
but I think she's got
control issues, too.

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:07.240
I can do that.

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:13.910
You know what?
You're just creeping me out.

00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:16.960
Wait, what's this?
-No way.

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:19.320
You turning on something?

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:23.080
I sure am.
My good looks.

00:21:38.050 --> 00:21:41.660
I can't believe we're
under the ruins.

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:56.750
What's that?

00:21:57.070 --> 00:21:59.020
The time-space axis.

00:21:59.020 --> 00:22:01.530
Time-space axis?
-Yes, that's right.

00:22:01.850 --> 00:22:04.440
It indicated the condition
of every small change

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:07.100
in the time-space continuum.
-Amazing!

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:09.270
We use it to investigate those places,

00:22:09.270 --> 00:22:11.630
where time and space
have been disrupted.

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:13.690
Time and space disruptions?

00:22:14.030 --> 00:22:17.990
That's correct. We watched
the strange mutations at Alamos Town.

00:22:32.020 --> 00:22:35.400
And when that hole in time and space
opened near the glacier,

00:22:35.760 --> 00:22:37.360
we were there, too.

00:22:45.040 --> 00:22:48.220
Here's our world,
which is in turn supported by this,

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:50.120
Giratina's Reverse World.

00:22:52.650 --> 00:22:54.870
Here we have the dimension of Dialga.

00:22:55.190 --> 00:22:57.490
Here, Palkia's dimension.

00:22:57.490 --> 00:23:00.590
On top of that,
Arceus' dimension.

00:23:00.740 --> 00:23:03.620
What's Arceus' dimension?
-I never heard of it.

00:23:03.620 --> 00:23:06.140
Is it a Pokemon?
-Right.

00:23:06.140 --> 00:23:09.620
The legendary Pokemon,
said to have created its entire world.

00:23:09.890 --> 00:23:13.100
Entire world?
-By a Pokemon.

00:23:13.100 --> 00:23:16.460
It's also said to have created
these world, too.

00:23:18.390 --> 00:23:20.810
A Pokemon that
creates entire worlds.

00:23:20.810 --> 00:23:25.270
Well, isn't that special.
-I wouldn't wanna meet it in a dark alley.

00:23:25.270 --> 00:23:27.260
There is an omen that predicts Arceus,

00:23:27.260 --> 00:23:30.520
will soon awaken from its long slumber.

00:23:30.520 --> 00:23:30.630
Long slumber?
will soon awaken from its long slumber.

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:31.710
Long slumber?

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.450
Massive whirlpools of energy
are beginning to form around Arceus,

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:38.400
as it begins to awaken.

00:23:43.720 --> 00:23:46.260
These whirlpools are distorting space

00:23:46.260 --> 00:23:48.920
and brought Dialga and Palkia's dimensions,

00:23:48.920 --> 00:23:51.370
which were designed to remain
eternally separated,

00:23:51.370 --> 00:23:53.450
into contact with each other.

00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:01.020
So Dialga and Palkia,
who shouldn't ever have meet,

00:24:01.020 --> 00:24:03.320
collided with one another
in Alamos Town.

00:24:03.320 --> 00:24:06.670
While both of them thought
the other had tried to threatened its territory.

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:07.980
Exactly.

00:24:08.740 --> 00:24:10.890
There battle also affected
the Reverse World,

00:24:10.890 --> 00:24:13.290
which brought Giratina into
the conflict, as well.

00:24:19.180 --> 00:24:21.430
But, Sheena, you already
resolved the conflict

00:24:21.430 --> 00:24:23.470
between Dialga and Palkia, didn't you?

00:24:23.470 --> 00:24:27.570
Yes.
-Wait a minute, why didn't Giratina understand you?

00:24:27.570 --> 00:24:32.520
When the Pokemon is overcome by rage,
she can't connect with it's heart.

00:24:37.680 --> 00:24:38.720
Rage?

00:25:18.760 --> 00:25:21.360
You see, we've been using
the altar to pinpoint

00:25:21.360 --> 00:25:23.540
the moment when Arceus will appear.

00:25:23.550 --> 00:25:24.870
Why will it do that?

00:25:24.870 --> 00:25:27.330
It holds a grudge against humanity.

00:25:27.490 --> 00:25:30.820
Arceus remains intent
on bringing us all to justice.

00:25:32.270 --> 00:25:34.330
Justice?
-Yes, justice.

00:25:34.330 --> 00:25:37.550
It's possible that Arceus will
destroy us entirely.

00:25:37.550 --> 00:25:39.970
A Pokemon destroying
all people!

00:25:39.970 --> 00:25:41.880
No way!
It can't be.

00:25:42.080 --> 00:25:43.890
Have a look at this.

00:25:47.350 --> 00:25:49.520
It's a legend of this place.

00:25:49.520 --> 00:25:51.970
Look at that!
-It's Arceus!

00:25:51.970 --> 00:25:54.210
When it appeared
that fragments from the stars

00:25:54.210 --> 00:25:56.030
would destroy much of the Pokemon,

00:25:57.670 --> 00:26:01.990
Arceus sacrificed itself
in order to fend off the danger.

00:26:01.990 --> 00:26:06.060
So it stopped meteors?
-Awesome, what an incredible Pokemon.

00:26:06.060 --> 00:26:09.480
Arceus had been carrying the
16 life plates around with it

00:26:09.480 --> 00:26:12.320
that could be used to
counter all possible attacks.

00:26:13.250 --> 00:26:16.170
But it lost the life plates
in a collision with meteors,

00:26:16.170 --> 00:26:18.390
making his death
at near certainty.

00:26:19.160 --> 00:26:22.220
Then Arceus was saved
by a man named Damos,

00:26:24.040 --> 00:26:27.110
who returned the life plates
to its rightful owner.

00:26:30.870 --> 00:26:33.860
Back then Michina was
little more then a wasteland,

00:26:33.860 --> 00:26:35.730
spreading out over the land.

00:26:37.320 --> 00:26:40.500
But when Arceus saw this,
it was overcome with pity.

00:26:41.240 --> 00:26:45.490
So it removed the powers of
water, grass, ground and electricity

00:26:45.490 --> 00:26:48.580
from the life plates
and on top of that, dragon.

00:26:48.960 --> 00:26:53.120
It then combined then into one,
making the Jewel of Life.

00:26:54.450 --> 00:26:56.420
Wow.
The Jewel of Life.

00:26:56.910 --> 00:27:00.770
Arceus trusted Damos
and bestowed upon him the Jewel of Life,

00:27:00.770 --> 00:27:04.090
even though this meant putting its
own life in grave danger.

00:27:09.180 --> 00:27:12.740
Arceus' magnificent strength
flowed out of the Jewel of Life,

00:27:12.740 --> 00:27:16.750
turning that wasteland,
that was Michina, into a fertile paradise.

00:27:16.750 --> 00:27:17.860
Awesome.

00:27:18.170 --> 00:27:22.790
And then came the day,
when Damos was to return the Jewel.

00:27:23.010 --> 00:27:25.830
The day when the moon
covered the sun.

00:27:26.770 --> 00:27:28.570
A solar eclipse.

00:27:28.730 --> 00:27:32.690
Yes.
However, Damos broke his promise,

00:27:32.690 --> 00:27:36.570
and instead of returning the Jewel of Life,
he attacked Arceus.

00:27:36.570 --> 00:27:39.380
But why?
-Well, Damos believed,

00:27:39.380 --> 00:27:42.350
if he were to return the Jewel,
this area would go back

00:27:42.350 --> 00:27:44.600
to being an uncultivated wasteland.

00:27:46.480 --> 00:27:50.070
Feeling profoundly betrayed,
Arceus fell into a rage

00:27:50.070 --> 00:27:53.220
and destroyed this shrine.
And then,

00:27:53.220 --> 00:27:55.530
in order to heal itself
from his injuries,

00:27:55.530 --> 00:27:58.030
Arceus began a long sleep.

00:28:01.940 --> 00:28:04.020
I can see,
why Arceus was upset.

00:28:04.020 --> 00:28:07.060
And Arceus went as far as
to give a part of itself

00:28:07.060 --> 00:28:08.810
to try and help Damos.

00:28:08.810 --> 00:28:12.010
So, in the end it was Damos,
that acted so terribly.

00:28:13.400 --> 00:28:16.750
Damos is my ancestor.

00:28:17.660 --> 00:28:19.010
And this ...

00:28:19.840 --> 00:28:21.910
Is the Jewel of Life.

00:28:26.770 --> 00:28:28.890
The mother load.
That's it.

00:28:28.890 --> 00:28:31.020
That Jewel is what
I'm talking about.

00:28:31.020 --> 00:28:33.350
The jewel of a jewel.
-First things first.

00:28:33.350 --> 00:28:35.950
We need that.
-And what about Arceus?

00:28:35.950 --> 00:28:39.380
We need that, too.
-The thrill of double prizes.

00:28:39.380 --> 00:28:44.650
Catching munchkins means one thing,
we'll be legends too.

00:28:47.960 --> 00:28:50.710
Return those to Arceus,
the Jewel of Life,

00:28:50.710 --> 00:28:54.490
placate its rage,
less destruction visit this land.

00:28:56.530 --> 00:28:58.100
See, it is written.

00:28:58.400 --> 00:29:00.650
It's a message to us
from our ancestors.

00:29:00.650 --> 00:29:03.420
So then, that means,
they realise their mistake.

00:29:03.420 --> 00:29:04.320
Yes.

00:29:04.830 --> 00:29:07.520
We must return the Jewel of Life to Arceus,

00:29:07.520 --> 00:29:09.420
so that we may calm its wrath.

00:29:14.250 --> 00:29:15.930
What's going on?

00:29:18.480 --> 00:29:20.750
Now!
Arceus is coming!

00:29:52.210 --> 00:29:56.190
The time has come.
Prepare for justice!

00:30:34.830 --> 00:30:36.100
Damos?

00:30:49.900 --> 00:30:52.390
Arceus, please!
You've got to stop!

00:30:53.850 --> 00:30:55.110
Who are you?

00:30:55.460 --> 00:30:57.550
I am a descendant of Damos, you see,

00:30:57.550 --> 00:31:00.860
and I know my ancestor
did a terrible thing to you.

00:31:01.740 --> 00:31:03.620
Please, forgive us!

00:31:05.180 --> 00:31:08.050
That's the Pokemon, right?
-Arceus, yes.

00:31:08.050 --> 00:31:10.780
And I bet money, that hulk
ain't so pleased.

00:31:15.510 --> 00:31:18.250
This is the Jewel of Life.
-What?

00:31:18.950 --> 00:31:21.700
Here, I humbly return it to you.

00:31:27.570 --> 00:31:30.200
My family has been protecting it
so that one day

00:31:30.200 --> 00:31:32.470
we might present it to you again.

00:31:32.980 --> 00:31:34.950
Heads up, guys!
Grab it now!

00:31:34.950 --> 00:31:37.320
James can,
since he's a guy.

00:31:37.320 --> 00:31:40.830
I insist, ladies first.
-Meowth's first.

00:31:40.830 --> 00:31:42.370
No, James!

00:31:51.520 --> 00:31:55.170
You're saying
this is the Jewel of Life?!

00:32:06.410 --> 00:32:09.460
The Jewel of Life is a part of me,

00:32:09.600 --> 00:32:12.870
it can not and will not break!

00:32:12.870 --> 00:32:14.300
Sheena!

00:32:36.910 --> 00:32:39.820
We're blasting off again!

00:32:50.640 --> 00:32:52.880
A forgery.
But how?

00:32:52.880 --> 00:32:55.340
I don't get it, Sheena.
What's going on?

00:32:55.340 --> 00:32:59.810
I don't know.
I truly thought it was the real thing all along.

00:32:59.810 --> 00:33:02.020
OK, so where's the real one?

00:33:02.790 --> 00:33:06.110
I won't let humanity deceive any more!

00:33:06.110 --> 00:33:07.720
Arceus, wait!

00:33:08.780 --> 00:33:13.010
I swear, I had no idea
it was a counterfeit, please believe me!

00:33:13.010 --> 00:33:17.020
Now, transcend the confines
of time and space.

00:33:27.340 --> 00:33:28.780
Sheena!

00:33:31.740 --> 00:33:33.750
Arceus' rage is to strong.

00:33:36.380 --> 00:33:38.970
You shall be brought to justice!

00:34:04.770 --> 00:34:07.530
Are you siding with the humans?!

00:34:26.680 --> 00:34:30.870
Palkia's attacks aren't working.
-Arceus has to be using the life plates,

00:34:30.870 --> 00:34:33.030
to defend against its opponents attacks.

00:34:40.830 --> 00:34:42.880
Out of my way!

00:34:55.470 --> 00:34:56.850
What do we do?

00:35:01.370 --> 00:35:04.610
Dialga,
it's trying to tell me something?

00:35:05.590 --> 00:35:08.420
Not even magical creatures shall be forgiven,

00:35:08.420 --> 00:35:10.410
for siding with human beings.

00:35:10.410 --> 00:35:12.340
Take this!

00:35:13.490 --> 00:35:14.970
Dialga!

00:35:15.410 --> 00:35:17.800
Come on, Arceus, stop this!

00:35:26.280 --> 00:35:28.260
Oh, no, if this keeps up ...

00:35:29.090 --> 00:35:31.260
Pikachu use Thunder Bolt!

00:35:35.640 --> 00:35:36.340
What?!

00:35:36.340 --> 00:35:37.450
Did it work?

00:35:37.450 --> 00:35:40.310
Remember, that Arceus lost
several of its life plates,

00:35:40.310 --> 00:35:43.410
including those that works defense
against electric type attacks.

00:35:43.690 --> 00:35:46.530
That's right!
Pikachu use Thunder Bolt again!

00:35:49.730 --> 00:35:51.970
Out of my way!

00:35:53.170 --> 00:35:56.200
You all shall be brought to justice!

00:35:56.200 --> 00:35:57.860
Everyone, get away!

00:36:07.960 --> 00:36:09.340
Giratina!

00:36:09.570 --> 00:36:11.630
Giratina understands!

00:36:38.780 --> 00:36:41.990
Palkia is distorting space
to stop Arceus now.

00:36:46.320 --> 00:36:48.120
Dialga.

00:37:17.680 --> 00:37:19.370
What's going on?

00:37:19.560 --> 00:37:22.020
How is this happening?

00:37:29.620 --> 00:37:31.010
It's night time.

00:37:31.220 --> 00:37:32.700
Not exactly.

00:37:36.040 --> 00:37:37.830
An eclipse.
-Yeah, but when ...

00:37:37.830 --> 00:37:37.950
Look!
The ruins!
An eclipse.
-Yeah, but when ...

00:37:37.950 --> 00:37:40.060
Look!
The ruins!

00:37:41.250 --> 00:37:42.810
What's going on?

00:37:42.810 --> 00:37:45.130
Dialga must've sent us into the past.

00:37:45.400 --> 00:37:47.720
What?
-To the past?

00:37:48.010 --> 00:37:48.830
Yes.

00:37:49.360 --> 00:37:52.960
Back to the day of the
fated promise with Arceus.

00:38:15.770 --> 00:38:19.360
It is time to return the Jewel of Life.

00:38:19.360 --> 00:38:21.940
So, that means,
that must be Arceus in the past.

00:38:21.940 --> 00:38:23.710
It sure looks looks that way.

00:38:28.930 --> 00:38:35.290
Here is the Jewel of Life!
I will come inside! Please, follow me.

00:38:56.210 --> 00:38:58.500
There.
Now, take it!

00:39:05.740 --> 00:39:07.770
What are you doing?

00:39:13.780 --> 00:39:17.040
What in the world?
-The time-space axis showed this.

00:39:17.040 --> 00:39:19.670
Damos never returned the Jewel of Life.

00:39:19.670 --> 00:39:22.530
Instead, he attacked Arceus.

00:39:30.170 --> 00:39:32.690
Wow, that's Damos.

00:39:56.690 --> 00:39:58.510
Can it be?

00:39:58.510 --> 00:40:00.860
It's not!
It's counterfeit!

00:40:00.860 --> 00:40:03.880
The real one is right here!

00:40:03.940 --> 00:40:06.630
I could never give you
the real Jewel of Life!

00:40:12.700 --> 00:40:14.430
You fool!

00:40:19.670 --> 00:40:22.940
Michina will flourish forever more!

00:40:23.200 --> 00:40:26.550
And never will it turn into a wasteland!

00:40:51.580 --> 00:40:56.160
You have betrayed me
and are trying to destroy me!

00:41:10.660 --> 00:41:12.320
They're falling!

00:41:22.060 --> 00:41:24.900
It's to dangerous here!
-What shall we do?

00:41:25.270 --> 00:41:29.640
Please, Dialga, send us
back further into the past!

00:41:55.290 --> 00:41:57.120
Still breathing.

00:42:15.410 --> 00:42:17.040
What is that?

00:42:39.620 --> 00:42:41.350
The sun is shining again.

00:42:41.350 --> 00:42:43.630
Looks like Dialga did
what you asked.

00:43:00.240 --> 00:43:03.910
What is this?
-Master Marcus, strange people have appeared.

00:43:05.680 --> 00:43:07.290
That man ...

00:43:10.980 --> 00:43:13.800
Bronzong, use Hypnosis.

00:43:22.440 --> 00:43:25.400
You people are clearly
not of this land.

00:43:25.400 --> 00:43:27.470
Yes, we have come here
from the future.

00:43:27.470 --> 00:43:30.650
What?
-To stop you from battling with Arceus.

00:43:32.570 --> 00:43:34.280
Such strange words you speak.

00:43:34.280 --> 00:43:37.290
-We know everything,
that's gonna happen in the future.

00:43:37.290 --> 00:43:39.720
Oh ..
-Please, believe me!

00:43:41.900 --> 00:43:45.330
Well then, let us hear
what this woman has to say.

00:43:46.460 --> 00:43:49.870
Have the children wait in the cell.
Take good care of them.

00:43:49.960 --> 00:43:50.950
Sir!

00:45:12.970 --> 00:45:14.290
In here.

00:45:26.890 --> 00:45:29.340
Hey!
Tell us where we are, anyway!

00:45:29.340 --> 00:45:31.140
What do we have here?

00:45:31.950 --> 00:45:34.500
You see, this is the underground prison

00:45:34.500 --> 00:45:37.100
and one of Master Marcus's
magical creatures

00:45:37.100 --> 00:45:40.100
just used Hypnosis on all of you.
-Magical?

00:45:40.100 --> 00:45:43.610
He means Pokemon.
-I see, that was Bronzong.

00:45:47.670 --> 00:45:50.560
Where's Pikachu?
-And what happened to Piplup?

00:45:50.560 --> 00:45:51.690
And Sheena?

00:45:51.690 --> 00:45:56.230
There safe.
Sheena is speaking with Master Marcus right now.

00:45:56.230 --> 00:45:58.790
Marcus?
-Yeah, remember?

00:46:01.620 --> 00:46:03.770
I wonder, who Marcus is.

00:46:04.230 --> 00:46:05.920
A backstabber.

00:46:07.760 --> 00:46:11.500
It's true, you see.
Marcus was an underling of mine,

00:46:11.500 --> 00:46:13.690
but he tricked me
and threw me in jail.

00:46:19.510 --> 00:46:21.160
You must be ...
-Damos!

00:46:21.420 --> 00:46:24.000
Wait, you saying you know me?
-Yes, of course!

00:46:24.000 --> 00:46:26.570
But, you're not from here.
-I want to know,

00:46:26.570 --> 00:46:29.150
why you won't return
the Jewel of Life to Arceus.

00:46:29.150 --> 00:46:32.080
And why are you setting
a trap for Arceus, too?

00:46:32.920 --> 00:46:34.740
I am doing nothing of the sort!

00:46:35.200 --> 00:46:36.820
I have every intention of returning

00:46:36.820 --> 00:46:39.340
the Jewel of Life to Arceus!
-You're a liar!

00:46:39.520 --> 00:46:43.460
It's the truth!
That's why Marcus put me in jail!

00:46:43.460 --> 00:46:46.220
To keep me from doing
that very thing.

00:46:48.240 --> 00:46:49.990
May I say something?

00:46:49.990 --> 00:46:53.290
That man is definitely
speaking the truth.

00:46:53.290 --> 00:46:56.470
I absolutely know, for a fact,
that Damos was attempting to

00:46:56.470 --> 00:46:59.060
return the Jewel of Life
back to Arceus.

00:46:59.060 --> 00:47:01.360
What I'm completely uncertain about is,

00:47:01.360 --> 00:47:03.330
whether or not that's the correct action,

00:47:03.330 --> 00:47:06.180
for Damos, to take.
-So you're telling the truth.

00:47:06.180 --> 00:47:09.720
Hey, the Hypnosis!
-Right, Bronzong used it!

00:47:09.720 --> 00:47:14.020
So Marcus must have used Hypnosis
on Damos and manipulated him, as well.

00:47:14.020 --> 00:47:15.530
Of course!

00:47:16.060 --> 00:47:19.180
Hold on, what in the world
are you talking about!

00:47:19.430 --> 00:47:21.510
We came here from the future,
you see.

00:47:21.690 --> 00:47:22.730
The future?

00:47:24.020 --> 00:47:25.600
Take a look at this.

00:47:29.770 --> 00:47:33.010
Magical creature.
-In the future this is called a PokeBall.

00:47:33.690 --> 00:47:38.480
Return!
'Course, you don't have these yet.

00:47:38.480 --> 00:47:39.810
And back were we come from,

00:47:39.810 --> 00:47:42.800
what you call magical creature,
we call Pokemon.

00:47:42.980 --> 00:47:44.210
Pokemon?

00:47:44.630 --> 00:47:46.160
I understand it now.

00:47:46.330 --> 00:47:48.420
You said, you all came here
from the future

00:47:48.420 --> 00:47:50.330
and you were telling the truth.

00:47:50.330 --> 00:47:54.240
Damos has no intention of returning
the Jewel of Life back to Arceus.

00:47:54.240 --> 00:47:57.520
I'm certain of that.
-I see.

00:47:57.520 --> 00:48:01.130
But then, if Arceus doesn't
get the Jewel of Life back,

00:48:01.130 --> 00:48:03.420
terrible things will start to happen!

00:48:04.320 --> 00:48:05.870
What kinda things?

00:48:06.100 --> 00:48:08.200
Concerning you and Damos.

00:48:12.740 --> 00:48:16.100
What are you saying?
-You have to trust me, please!

00:48:39.100 --> 00:48:40.350
Quit dilly-dallying.

00:48:47.640 --> 00:48:49.840
No goofing off!

00:49:11.450 --> 00:49:14.160
Don't come near me!
Stay back!

00:49:14.160 --> 00:49:15.420
What do you want?

00:49:57.460 --> 00:49:58.700
Hey, wait!

00:50:13.850 --> 00:50:17.990
Ok, you guys.
I think we'll be able to chill out here.

00:50:21.370 --> 00:50:25.590
Could it be?
Say, its a helmet from ancient times!

00:50:25.590 --> 00:50:29.170
Wow, check this out!
We're talking ancient crown here!

00:50:29.170 --> 00:50:32.990
Feast your eyes!
Doesn't this antique tiara complement my modern look?

00:50:34.010 --> 00:50:36.020
This place is teeming with treasure!

00:50:36.990 --> 00:50:39.270
I love work,
when you are using your head!

00:50:54.090 --> 00:50:56.910
Palkia, please, hold on.
I beg you.

00:51:02.250 --> 00:51:05.610
So you're telling me,
I betray Arceus in the future?

00:51:05.610 --> 00:51:09.630
That's it.
-That's what the legend says and...

00:51:09.630 --> 00:51:12.760
The people of Michina saw
you as an evil man from then on.

00:51:12.760 --> 00:51:15.320
As if I could ever betray Arceus!

00:51:19.430 --> 00:51:22.840
Arceus,
who saved us all.

00:51:48.230 --> 00:51:51.130
If this keeps up,
it's the end of the world.

00:52:00.190 --> 00:52:01.810
It's Arceus!

00:53:00.890 --> 00:53:05.450
The world has escaped destruction.

00:53:27.080 --> 00:53:29.320
Arceus, please.

00:53:30.890 --> 00:53:35.450
Transcend the confines
of time and space.

00:56:05.910 --> 00:56:07.140
Human.

00:56:07.400 --> 00:56:09.940
Are you the one who saved me?

00:56:10.330 --> 00:56:13.390
Oh, no, no, Arceus.
It was you who saved us!

00:56:19.940 --> 00:56:25.110
But then, terrible things had happened
to our beloved town Michina.

00:56:26.280 --> 00:56:28.630
It struggled for its survival.

00:56:32.260 --> 00:56:36.170
If it keeps up like this,
we won't survive the winter.

00:56:36.330 --> 00:56:37.760
Damos.

00:56:40.140 --> 00:56:43.820
You want to revitalize this land.
Don't you?

00:56:44.060 --> 00:56:45.150
Yes.

00:57:05.600 --> 00:57:07.740
How pitiful.

00:57:08.890 --> 00:57:12.600
All right.
I shall lend you my strength.

00:57:15.980 --> 00:57:18.440
These keep me alive.

00:57:18.670 --> 00:57:21.430
They are a part of my being.

00:57:23.310 --> 00:57:29.030
The power of ground,
water and grass.

00:57:29.290 --> 00:57:33.130
And combined with this,
the power of electricity,

00:57:33.130 --> 00:57:35.720
they all meld together.

00:57:35.750 --> 00:57:39.910
And with the power of dragon,
they increase.

00:57:50.970 --> 00:57:54.580
Use this Jewel of Life
for the greater good.

00:57:54.580 --> 00:57:57.620
To make the land rich and fertile.

00:57:58.000 --> 00:58:01.410
The Jewel of Life.
-But ...

00:58:03.860 --> 00:58:08.240
Without that Jewel, my life is diminished.

00:58:09.920 --> 00:58:16.740
Damos, I am trusting you.
Trusting you with my life.

00:58:20.180 --> 00:58:22.030
Arceus, I thank you.

00:58:26.970 --> 00:58:31.280
You have my word.
I will return it back to you.

00:58:55.640 --> 00:58:57.760
Through the grace of the Jewel of Life,

00:58:57.760 --> 00:59:00.300
the land blossomed and flourished.

00:59:03.280 --> 00:59:08.640
Mr. Damos, it looks like
we'll be able to harvest this year, too.

00:59:09.060 --> 00:59:11.400
That's right, we shall all work together.

00:59:12.820 --> 00:59:17.610
Soon, I'll be able to return the Jewel of Life.
-I understand.

00:59:17.610 --> 00:59:22.130
I will wait, until the time
the moon next covers the sun.

00:59:22.130 --> 00:59:26.550
Thank you.
Until then I will continue revitalizing the land.

00:59:37.220 --> 00:59:40.040
And so, the days past by.

00:59:40.380 --> 00:59:44.040
And I constructed a shrine,
dedicated to Arceus.

00:59:44.040 --> 00:59:47.760
To show my enormous and eternal gratitude.

00:59:54.480 --> 00:59:57.130
And today the moon will cover the sun.

00:59:57.690 --> 00:59:59.720
Then today is the day of the promise.

01:00:00.780 --> 01:00:03.470
From what you know,
would you mind telling me,

01:00:03.470 --> 01:00:06.490
what sort of attacks Damos
might have used on Arceus.

01:00:06.740 --> 01:00:10.710
He used several electric attacks
and then dropped a boulder on Arceus.

01:00:10.710 --> 01:00:12.670
What about silver water?

01:00:15.250 --> 01:00:17.200
I guess he didn't use it.

01:00:18.440 --> 01:00:20.760
Understood.
I believe you.

01:00:21.090 --> 01:00:23.760
I shall stop Damos at once.

01:00:24.380 --> 01:00:26.990
We must return the Jewel of Life to Arceus.

01:00:34.940 --> 01:00:40.050
This is the Jewel of Life.
You shall return it to Arceus.

01:00:48.030 --> 01:00:51.420
Let's go.
You shall change history.

01:00:51.930 --> 01:00:54.050
Thanks you, sir.

01:02:21.080 --> 01:02:23.470
How do we get out of this join?

01:02:23.690 --> 01:02:26.590
And there's no trace of twerps.

01:02:26.690 --> 01:02:29.190
Twerps smurfs.
I need a nap.

01:02:56.240 --> 01:02:59.010
Enough already!

01:03:09.610 --> 01:03:11.930
Wipeout!

01:03:37.530 --> 01:03:41.930
I must go.
I must return the Jewel of Life to Arceus.

01:03:41.930 --> 01:03:44.480
But how are you going to get
yourself out of here?

01:03:44.480 --> 01:03:46.390
I have friends as well.

01:03:50.910 --> 01:03:52.340
Pichu.

01:03:52.860 --> 01:03:54.720
Thanks so much.

01:04:00.620 --> 01:04:03.650
Pikachu!
-Thank goodness you are safe, Piplup.

01:04:03.650 --> 01:04:04.970
What a relief.

01:04:07.000 --> 01:04:09.810
Oh, so they helped you out too, did they?

01:04:10.370 --> 01:04:13.120
Damos, you can see
the hearts of Pokemon as well, right?

01:04:13.800 --> 01:04:17.160
That's because he's Sheena's ancestor.
-Yeah, that's right.

01:04:25.920 --> 01:04:28.710
Thanks you.
Children, from the future.

01:04:31.040 --> 01:04:32.710
Hey, Damos!

01:05:00.450 --> 01:05:04.580
It is time to return
the Jewel of Life.

01:05:11.980 --> 01:05:15.520
My name is Sheena.
Here is the Jewel of Life.

01:05:16.570 --> 01:05:19.840
Where is Damos?
-He isn't coming.

01:05:20.070 --> 01:05:24.740
Did something happen to him?
-He was going to betray you.

01:05:24.740 --> 01:05:29.890
It can't be.
-Yes, it's true, but I have the Jewel...

01:05:38.850 --> 01:05:43.140
You have deceived me!
-That's not true!

01:05:56.540 --> 01:05:58.800
Now, the silver water!

01:06:19.820 --> 01:06:21.670
What's this?

01:06:29.150 --> 01:06:32.530
Something's not right.
-Maybe, we're too late.

01:06:33.410 --> 01:06:35.120
There's Sheena!

01:06:39.170 --> 01:06:41.630
The Jewel of Life is right here.

01:06:41.630 --> 01:06:44.660
But I'm not just gonna
give it back to you.

01:06:44.660 --> 01:06:46.670
You ...
How could you do this?

01:06:46.670 --> 01:06:49.720
Many thanks for telling me
all about the future, dear.

01:06:49.720 --> 01:06:52.360
Because now,
history's about to change.

01:07:00.300 --> 01:07:02.580
Stop it!
All of you!

01:07:13.750 --> 01:07:16.500
Was that Damos, just now?
-Yeah.

01:07:17.350 --> 01:07:21.150
Ash, wait! -I'm gonna get the
Jewel of Life back from Marcus.

01:07:23.530 --> 01:07:26.290
Are you hurt?
-Who are you?

01:07:39.870 --> 01:07:41.300
Damos.

01:07:41.300 --> 01:07:44.000
I know this wasn't your fault.

01:07:44.270 --> 01:07:46.420
You must be Sheena.
-Right.

01:07:46.840 --> 01:07:49.260
I did something foolish.

01:07:51.740 --> 01:07:55.370
If only I had realised,
Marcus would betray me this way.

01:08:05.450 --> 01:08:07.370
Sudowoodo!

01:08:09.490 --> 01:08:10.980
Use Hammer Arm!

01:08:18.210 --> 01:08:20.130
Good work!
Return!

01:08:26.560 --> 01:08:29.390
Now, Michina will forever flourish.

01:08:29.670 --> 01:08:31.560
The end of desolation.

01:08:33.840 --> 01:08:34.970
Marcus!

01:08:35.530 --> 01:08:38.570
You give the Jewel of Life to Arceus
right now, or else!

01:08:38.570 --> 01:08:40.160
It's too late for that!

01:08:40.520 --> 01:08:42.080
It belongs to us now!

01:08:42.290 --> 01:08:43.530
Heatran!

01:08:44.450 --> 01:08:46.490
Quick Pikachu,
use Thunder Bolt!

01:08:51.530 --> 01:08:52.990
Bronzong!

01:09:01.130 --> 01:09:02.430
Look out!

01:09:10.040 --> 01:09:13.080
I'm certain that one day,
you all will thank me.

01:09:13.080 --> 01:09:14.180
What for?

01:09:14.180 --> 01:09:18.380
Because I am saving the future.
-Saving the future?

01:09:18.380 --> 01:09:21.550
Arceus will perish here.
Which means there won't be a way

01:09:21.550 --> 01:09:24.120
for Arceus to appear
in the future ever again.

01:09:26.140 --> 01:09:28.390
I am changing history!

01:09:38.510 --> 01:09:41.980
Damos!
Why did you betray me?

01:09:42.400 --> 01:09:43.820
Why?!

01:09:50.230 --> 01:09:52.790
All right, Pikachu,
use Volt Tackle!

01:09:56.540 --> 01:09:58.560
Now, Piplup,
use Whirlpool!

01:09:58.560 --> 01:10:01.300
Pikachu, Thunder Bolt,
let's go!

01:10:21.530 --> 01:10:23.510
Sheena,
give me your hand.

01:10:28.540 --> 01:10:31.900
Transcend the confines
of time and space.

01:10:42.300 --> 01:10:43.880
<i>Everyone ...</i>

01:10:47.620 --> 01:10:51.500
<i>Arceus sacrificed its very life,
to save us,</i>

01:10:51.690 --> 01:10:54.870
<i> and also to save our land.</i>

01:11:18.640 --> 01:11:22.300
Magical creatures live in the shrine?
-Can you guys help us?

01:11:24.040 --> 01:11:24.990
All right!

01:11:33.450 --> 01:11:35.690
<i>Everyone, stop your attacks!</i>

01:11:53.310 --> 01:11:55.300
They stopped attacking!

01:12:13.080 --> 01:12:16.340
<i>Arceus, please,
look at me!</i>

01:12:26.400 --> 01:12:28.010
Sheena!

01:12:37.060 --> 01:12:40.230
Heatran, Bronzong,
take care of this!

01:12:45.620 --> 01:12:47.150
What the...

01:13:41.150 --> 01:13:42.910
Pikachu!

01:13:51.300 --> 01:13:53.020
K, here it comes!

01:14:00.450 --> 01:14:02.520
Way to go, Pikachu.

01:14:09.880 --> 01:14:12.230
Hey, Ash.
Pikachu.

01:14:15.320 --> 01:14:18.350
Hey, guys!
I got the Jewel of Life.

01:14:18.350 --> 01:14:22.650
Ash, great!
-Return it to Arceus, quickly!

01:14:22.880 --> 01:14:25.660
Right!
Let's go, buddy.

01:14:56.070 --> 01:14:57.400
Arceus!

01:14:57.930 --> 01:14:59.810
Look!
I brought you the Jewel of Life.

01:14:59.850 --> 01:15:01.780
So, please, take it!

01:15:08.930 --> 01:15:10.670
Arceus.

01:15:29.070 --> 01:15:30.640
Pikachu!

01:15:35.490 --> 01:15:37.800
What's going on?
-Oh, no!

01:15:39.430 --> 01:15:41.010
What's happening to me?

01:15:41.410 --> 01:15:43.240
You are disappearing.

01:15:43.840 --> 01:15:46.500
With Arceus no more,
there is no reason for you

01:15:46.500 --> 01:15:48.050
to have to come back here.

01:15:48.050 --> 01:15:50.320
History has changed.

01:15:59.830 --> 01:16:01.470
No, Arceus.

01:16:02.040 --> 01:16:04.220
You can't die! You can't!

01:16:07.410 --> 01:16:09.860
You can't leave this world hating us!

01:16:10.370 --> 01:16:12.160
I won't let you!

01:16:56.980 --> 01:16:59.190
Pikachu!

01:17:15.640 --> 01:17:17.640
Arceus!

01:17:49.250 --> 01:17:50.910
Damos.

01:17:53.160 --> 01:17:56.940
The Jewel of Life,
please, take it.

01:18:30.630 --> 01:18:32.640
Pikachu!

01:18:39.600 --> 01:18:40.980
We're back.

01:18:41.470 --> 01:18:42.830
Piplup!

01:18:43.770 --> 01:18:45.990
You are all fools.

01:18:47.820 --> 01:18:51.100
We're alive!
-Yes!

01:19:27.890 --> 01:19:29.690
Who are you?

01:19:29.870 --> 01:19:33.030
I'm Ash and this
is my partner Pikachu.

01:19:52.150 --> 01:19:54.540
Ash and Pikachu.

01:19:55.390 --> 01:20:00.450
Are you the ones who saved my life?
-It wasn't just us.

01:20:02.050 --> 01:20:03.390
Ash!

01:20:05.750 --> 01:20:07.570
You are alive.

01:20:07.960 --> 01:20:10.260
Everybody here did it.

01:20:18.740 --> 01:20:21.460
Arceus, please, forgive me.

01:20:21.960 --> 01:20:26.640
I already saw it in your heart.
It's all right.

01:20:28.520 --> 01:20:31.270
This is the end.
I know it.

01:20:31.270 --> 01:20:34.640
This place will once again
become a wasteland.

01:20:35.130 --> 01:20:38.100
For us there is no future.

01:21:35.900 --> 01:21:37.420
Awesome.

01:22:03.830 --> 01:22:06.950
I have used up all of my strength.

01:22:07.170 --> 01:22:09.990
So for now, I must rest.

01:22:11.130 --> 01:22:13.620
Farewell, Damos.

01:22:14.640 --> 01:22:21.770
Ash, Pikachu
and you...

01:22:24.890 --> 01:22:27.640
All of my beloved.

01:22:47.350 --> 01:22:49.880
Dialga is calling.
-Dialga?

01:22:50.440 --> 01:22:55.350
Time to return to the future.
-But I wanted to speak more.

01:22:56.970 --> 01:23:00.160
Me too.
-Yeah, me too. - Same here.

01:23:01.530 --> 01:23:04.060
But it's not to be,
future children.

01:23:16.720 --> 01:23:18.430
The future.

01:23:34.890 --> 01:23:36.790
Are we back?

01:23:38.820 --> 01:23:40.280
Giratina.

01:23:41.360 --> 01:23:43.030
And Dialga.

01:23:48.000 --> 01:23:49.950
Palkia, too.

01:23:55.320 --> 01:23:57.250
Arceus.
-It's still angry.

01:23:57.250 --> 01:23:58.870
But how?

01:24:04.600 --> 01:24:07.170
No, Arceus, no!!!

01:24:13.330 --> 01:24:15.630
Who are you?

01:24:38.260 --> 01:24:41.770
<i>I'm Ash and this
is my partner Pikachu.</i>

01:24:45.110 --> 01:24:47.270
Ash.

01:25:15.920 --> 01:25:18.140
History has been corrected.

01:25:32.570 --> 01:25:35.180
Washed up, again.

01:26:22.050 --> 01:26:25.660
Everything is back to normal.
-Thank goodness.

01:26:26.830 --> 01:26:28.170
Wait a minute.

01:26:28.200 --> 01:26:30.970
We returned the Jewel of Life in the past,

01:26:30.970 --> 01:26:33.840
which means this place
should be totally desolate.

01:26:34.010 --> 01:26:36.930
Arceus?
-This isn't my doing.

01:26:36.930 --> 01:26:40.770
Your ancestors dedicated their entire lives

01:26:40.770 --> 01:26:43.730
to cultivating and restoring this land.

01:26:43.730 --> 01:26:45.750
This place was brought back to life,

01:26:45.750 --> 01:26:49.340
by the efforts of people and Pokemon alike.

01:26:49.340 --> 01:26:52.350
I understand.
-Sheena, we did it.

01:26:52.350 --> 01:26:53.920
Right.
-Sheena!

01:26:56.800 --> 01:26:58.850
Kevin!

01:27:16.580 --> 01:27:20.300
Bye bye!
-Thanks for everything!

01:27:46.370 --> 01:27:48.940
Sheena,
look at this.

01:27:53.050 --> 01:27:55.010
Is that ...
-It's us.

01:27:55.430 --> 01:27:58.250
Damos must have left it,
knowing we would see it.

01:27:58.760 --> 01:28:00.730
There's something written here.

01:28:01.550 --> 01:28:04.210
To all of my beautiful
future children,

01:28:04.210 --> 01:28:06.010
who taught me how to believe.

01:28:06.700 --> 01:28:09.230
<i>I offer all of you now
my sincerest hopes</i>

01:28:09.230 --> 01:28:12.110
<i>and wishes, that the future world</i>

01:28:12.110 --> 01:28:14.420
<i>will become more and more beautiful.</i>

01:28:14.680 --> 01:28:19.030
<i>And that is exactly kind of world,
you find yourselves in.</i>

01:28:23.040 --> 01:28:24.970
Thank you, Damos.

01:28:26.630 --> 01:28:28.380
Ash.

01:28:33.570 --> 01:28:39.230
This world of yours
is truly a magnificent place.

01:28:40.770 --> 01:28:42.460
It is.

01:28:55.570 --> 01:29:01.140
And now, with great joy,
I have finally come to understand,

01:29:01.560 --> 01:29:05.220
that I am truly a part of it.

01:29:05.790 --> 01:29:07.470
See you, Arceus!

01:29:08.120 --> 01:29:13.440
Bye, Arceus!
-Thank you for everything!
